# Technology Stack

Do not substitute this stack without an explicit product decision.

| Layer | Choice |
| Frontend | Next.js App Router, React, TypeScript strict, Tailwind CSS, shadcn/ui |
| Backend | NestJS (TypeScript). Shared contracts only; no business rules in the UI |
| Data | PostgreSQL, Drizzle ORM, UUID primary keys, relational FKs, targeted indexes |
| i18n | `next-intl` on the web app; NestJS i18n for validation and report strings |

## Architecture

- `src/` — Next.js UI (`[locale]` routes, server components, shadcn)
- `api/` — NestJS HTTP API (auth, RBAC, domain modules)
- `src/db/` — Drizzle schema and client used by the API (and server-only Next code)
- Locales: `en`, `ar`, `ckb`. Translate UI, API validation errors, and reports

## Type safety

- `strict: true`. Domain types live next to the Drizzle schema
- Validate writes with Zod or class-validator. Never trust query/body shapes
- UUID PKs. Index tenant FKs (`kindergarten_id`), unique business codes, and audit `created_at`
